name: ['Abomination of Llanowar', 'Adorned Pouncer', 'Ammit Eternal', 'Blinkmoth Nexus', 'Bonesplitter', 'Coldsteel Heart', 'Collected Conjuring', "Death's Shadow", 'Declaration in Stone', 'Faith of the Devoted', 'Flameblade Adept', 'Goblin Gaveleer', 'Hamza, Guardian of Arashin', 'Harmless Offering', 'Iceberg Cancrix', 'Inspiring Statuary', 'Lys Alana Huntmaster', "Marit Lage's Slumber", 'Sawtusk Demolisher', 'Spider Spawning', 'Sword of Body and Mind', 'Think Twice', 'Thraben Inspector', 'Torment of Scarabs', 'Triumphant Reckoning']
